%% Pull-request feedback loop. Rendered by hand as pr-loop.html.
flowchart LR
    A[Draft PR] --> B[Comments and bot feedback]
    B --> C[Selected fixes]
    C --> D[Named checks]
    D --> E[commit-and-push]
    E --> F[CI]
    F -->|Failure| G[diagnose-ci]
    G --> C
    F -->|Pass| H[Named human approves and merges]
